<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>nobody</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">PRYVT</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">&amp;SCENE</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">5FjoK7GeOds70riyqCHdyE</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.543" end="00:29.043">Remember the time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.783" end="00:30.959">We were talking all night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.959" end="00:32.459">Feeling your breath</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.240" end="00:33.740">Under my skin</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.395" end="00:36.478">Were we falling in love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.478" end="00:39.536">Was it more than enough?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.536" end="00:42.766">Making me all feeling like a fool</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.766" end="00:46.337">Never mind, I never understood</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.337" end="00:48.096">Did it even matter to you?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.096" end="00:50.507">Calling it fun been losing it all</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.507" end="00:53.353">Thought you were the one</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.353" end="00:59.718">I don't wanna fall in love with nobody, nobody, nobody</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.718" end="01:06.967">Tell me did you ever wanna know 'bout me, know 'bout me, know 'bout me?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.967" end="01:10.006">Never really could’ve understand</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.006" end="01:13.332">Can we call this love?  Cause I’ve never had</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.332" end="01:20.249">I know nothing ever lasts but I wanted you too</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.249" end="01:25.522">Was it you babe?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.522" end="01:28.888">Regretting who I am</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.888" end="01:33.860">Cause of you babe</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.860" end="01:37.675">Tell me if you got anymore,say</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.675" end="01:41.189">You don't wanna stay and that's okay</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.189" end="01:42.739">Feelings may be gone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.739" end="01:48.477">But my memory will have you forever</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.477" end="01:54.842">I don't wanna fall in love with nobody, nobody, nobody</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.842" end="02:01.942">Tell me did you ever wanna know 'bout me, know 'bout me, know 'bout me?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.942" end="02:04.798">Never really could’ve understand</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.798" end="02:08.144">Can we call this love?  Cause I’ve never had</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.144" end="02:16.144">I know nothing ever lasts but I wanted you too</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:29.537" end="02:32.323">Never really could’ve understand</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:32.323" end="02:35.626">Can we call this love?  Cause I’ve never had</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:35.626" end="02:39.626">I know nothing ever lasts but I wanted you too</p></div></body></tt>